  "entry": "code/README.md",
  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). A single offline page that takes a soil lab's results workbook (or CSVs), checks it, and writes a DIGGS 3 XML file. It either adds the results to the borings and samples in an existing project DIGGS file or builds a new DIGGS file from boring coordinates the user types in. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
